# =====================================================================
# .gitignore - pos2018
# =====================================================================

# --- File sinh ra khi build, khong can luu vao git ---
# js.min/ va css.min/ van duoc COMMIT: index.html nap truc tiep hai thu
# muc nay, may POS tai tu GitHub nen can chung trong repo.
# (Neu xoa khoi git, app tai ve se khong chay.)

# Thu muc lam viec cua script build APK
android/build/

# File APK.
#
# CHI luu ban DANG PHAT HANH trong repo, de clone repo ve la co ngay file cai.
# Cac ban cu van nam trong GitHub Releases.
#
# Luu nhieu ban APK trong git se lam repo nang dan va cham lai: moi lan phat
# hanh la them ~460 KB vao lich su, khong xoa duoc. Release la noi dung cho
# lich su phat hanh; day chi la ban "ban hoan chinh" de tai.
dist/*
!dist/milano-pos-*.apk
!dist/milano-pos-*.apk.sha256
*.idsig
# Ban cu hon ban dang phat hanh
dist/milano-pos-1.0.0.*
dist/milano-pos-1.0.1.*
dist/milano-pos-1.0.2.*

# KHOA KY APK - TUYET DOI KHONG COMMIT
#
# android/keystore/pos259.jks la khoa rieng biet de ky app. Repo nay PUBLIC:
# commit file nay vao = BAT KY AI cung co the ky mot ban cap nhat "gia ma" va
# may POS se tu chap nhan no.
#
# Giu file nay o may (da co san) va sao luu ra noi khac.
# Mat file nay = khong the phat hanh ban cap nhat nua.
android/keystore/

# Ban sao luu
*.bak
*- Copy.js
*-copy.js
*- Copy.html

# File he thong
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini